id=thor-screenblank
name=Thor screen blank (screenblank)
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=local
description=Turn either of the AYN Thor's two internal panels genuinely off. Adds a `screenblank` root command (status/off/on/toggle/restore) that writes bl_power on that panel's backlight and disables that panel's digitiser IRQ - dark with no glow, and touch dead. Stock's own approach (an opaque type-2021 overlay plus sys.temp.disabled.touch) does not survive on LineageOS. Writes no thermal and no battery node; a reboot clears both writes and `screenblank restore` is an unconditional kill switch.
